<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roll round</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλύω</span>): only aor. 1
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυμὸς ἐπὶ γαῖαν
			ἐλύσθη</span> the pole <i>rolled</i> to the ground, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.393
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπάροιθε ποδῶν Ἀχιλῆος
				ἐλυσθείς</span>
			<i>rolled up, crouching</i> before Achilles' feet, <i><span class="en">
				24.510
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.281
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.1034
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λασίην ὑπὸ γαστέρ᾽ ἐλυσθείς</span>
			<i>coiled</i> close <i>up</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.433
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρως ὑπὸ καρδίην ἐλυσθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					103
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in later 
				Ep.
			, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλύω</span>
			, <i>wrap up, cover</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνὶ
				κτερέεσσιν ἐλυσθείς</span>
			<i>shrouded</i> in them, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.254
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πηλοῖσιν ἐλυσθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					3.418
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>H.</u>
				2.89
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ φλογὸς εἶθαρ ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1313
			</span></i>.</div>
